[00:00.00]Good morning, Grandma. What are you doing?|早上好，奶奶。你在做什么呀？
[00:07.00]Good morning, sweetie. I'm making zongzi.|早上好，宝贝。我在包粽子。
[00:12.00]Making zongzi? Can I help you?|包粽子？我可以帮忙吗？
[00:15.00]Sure. Come and join me.|当然，过来一起吧。
[00:18.00]First, fold the bamboo leaves.|先把竹叶折起来。
[00:23.00]Fold, fold. Like this?|折呀折。是这样吗？
[00:26.66]Yes, you're doing great.|对，你做得很好。
[00:28.90]Now fill it with sticky gneiss and red dates.|现在往里面填糯米和红枣。
[00:35.12]Fill, fill, it's full now.|填呀填，满啦。
[00:39.88]Now tie it tight with string.|现在用绳子把它绑紧。
[00:45.28]Tie, tie, tie, all done.|绑呀绑，绑好啦。
[00:48.26]Great job.|做得真棒。
[00:50.66]Into the pond, time to cook.|放进锅里，该煮啦。
[00:53.14]Cuck, cuck! They will be yummy!|咕嘟咕嘟！一定很好吃！
[00:59.14]They are ready. Let's eat together.|好啦，我们一起吃吧。
[01:06.14]Mmm, so yummy! I love Zongza so much!|嗯，真好吃！我太喜欢粽子了！
[01:12.14]I love Zongza too!|我也喜欢粽子！
